"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1796794426,"text":"うぅ…こんなんじゃ論文が書けない、どうすれば…","nextNodeIds":[718100102]},{"nodeId":718100102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":913039858,"text":"どうしたの？","nextNodeIds":[718100103]},{"nodeId":718100103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1785733762,"text":"…おや？君か！私を覚えてるかい？","nextNodeIds":[718100104]},{"nodeId":718100104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1172651442,"text":"霊矩関で宝盗団に捕らわれていた…はは…あの時は、助けてくれてありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[718100105]},{"nodeId":718100105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1726147778,"text":"どうしてここに？","nextNodeIds":[718100106]},{"nodeId":718100106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3803852882,"text":"ああ、あの時君に助けられた後、望舒旅館のソラヤーさんを訪ねたんだ。そこで運良く会えてね。","nextNodeIds":[718100107]},{"nodeId":718100107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3185681378,"text":"ソラヤーさんは本当にいい人だった。私に食べ物をくれたり、私が集めた資料を整理してくれた。","nextNodeIds":[718100108]},{"nodeId":718100108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":2413127482,"text":"でも…その後に教えてくれたんだ。私が選んだ課題は、すでに教令院で多くの人が書いたことがあるって。","nextNodeIds":[718100109]},{"nodeId":718100109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":945382658,"text":"とびっきり上手く書かない限りダメだと…だから他の視点から書いた方がいいって彼女から言われたんだ。例えば元素力とか。","nextNodeIds":[718100110]},{"nodeId":718100110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":2703226794,"text":"でも私は「神の目」を持ってないし、元素力も使えない。どうやって書くかさっぱり…","nextNodeIds":[718100111]},{"nodeId":718100111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3851148386,"text":"だからここに来て、何か使える資料がないか探してたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[718100112]},{"nodeId":718100112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":810369922,"text":"まてよ…前に私を助けてくれた時、戦い方が妙に…","nextNodeIds":[718100113]},{"nodeId":718100113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":63511410,"text":"君は「神の目」を持ってるの？","nextNodeIds":[718100114]},{"nodeId":718100114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1477315258,"text":"「神の目」は持ってない…","nextNodeIds":[718100115]},{"nodeId":718100115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":2400791202,"text":"あれ？「神の目」がないのにあんな戦い方ができるの？一体どんな原理で…","nextNodeIds":[718100116]},{"nodeId":718100116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":576264130,"text":"いや、原理はきっと複雑だからひとまず置いといて…君に頼みたいことがある。","nextNodeIds":[718100117]},{"nodeId":718100117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":622912378,"text":"私に君の戦い方を見せてくれないか？そうしたら、何かが分かって論文の役に立つかもしれない…","nextNodeIds":[718100118]},{"nodeId":718100118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1646452026,"text":"たのむよお願いだ！論文が書けないまま教令院に戻ったら、終わりなんだ…","nextNodeIds":[718100119,718100122]},{"nodeId":718100119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2681917834,"text":"分かった…","nextNodeIds":[718100120]},{"nodeId":718100120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":496725770,"text":"ありがとう！じゃあ野外に行こう。","nextNodeIds":[718100121]},{"nodeId":718100121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1850727482,"text":"前にヒルチャールの集落を見つけた。あれを相手にして、戦い方を見せてくれ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":718100122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":814901914,"text":"教令院って…そんなに怖いの？","nextNodeIds":[718100123]},{"nodeId":718100123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3533157058,"text":"怖いってもんじゃない、非常に恐ろしい…夢で見たらきっと泣いて覚めるよ。","nextNodeIds":[718