882058,"text":"こんなにたくさん見せてくれてありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[718100304]},{"nodeId":718100304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3664017610,"text":"はあ、私も「神の目」欲しいなあ…できれば「雷」属性。かっこよくて強いし。","nextNodeIds":[718100305]},{"nodeId":718100305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":4277390082,"text":"でも、雷属性の「神の目」なんて、一番ありえない…","nextNodeIds":[718100306]},{"nodeId":718100306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":220885066,"text":"努力すればなんとかなる。","nextNodeIds":[718100307]},{"nodeId":718100307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":2488822210,"text":"そんなわけないよ、雷属性の「神の目」は努力しても手に入らないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[718100308]},{"nodeId":718100308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":709130082,"text":"あれ？知らなかったの？ここ一年くらい、だれも雷属性の「神の目」を手にしてないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[718100309]},{"nodeId":718100309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1286007874,"text":"教令院もそのことについて研究してね。その結論が…「雷の神」の意志で、もう人に「神の目」を授けないと決めたらしい。","nextNodeIds":[718100310]},{"nodeId":718100310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1466357858,"text":"それに、稲妻を統率している「雷の神」は、「目狩り令」を発表したらしい。稲妻で「神の目」を持つ者の「神の目」を回収するとかなんとか。","nextNodeIds":[718100311]},{"nodeId":718100311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1636636778,"text":"もし「神の目」を持つ者が回収を拒んだら、重い罰が待ち受けて…","nextNodeIds":[718100312]},{"nodeId":718100312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3846870554,"text":"私も以前稲妻に関する課題の論文を書こうと思ったけど、危なそうだから、やめたんだ…","nextNodeIds":[718100313]},{"nodeId":718100313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":982931818,"text":"君は「神の目」がないから大丈夫。","nextNodeIds":[718100314]},{"nodeId":718100314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":2957889434,"text":"そんなことないよ！「神の目」を持つ者さえあんな扱いなのに、持ってない人はもっと大変だと思わないか？","nextNodeIds":[718100315]},{"nodeId":718100315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":4154300874,"text":"やはり璃月で論文を書いて、教令院に提出しよう。早くしないと、何を言われるか…","nextNodeIds":[718100316]},{"nodeId":718100316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3778994026,"text":"そうだ、こんなにたくさん見せてくれたんだ。これをあげる、お礼にね。","nextNodeIds":[718100317]},{"nodeId":718100317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":2336738034,"text":"よし、今回こそ論文を終わらせるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7181003,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133104916"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_FINISH","LNHLPKELCAL":["20088"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7181001,7181002,7181003],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","count":40},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":7}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[171810],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2172529550,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","